{"text":{"en":{"오일씰 형식 및 적용현황 | [회사명] 베어링":"Oil Seal Types and Applications | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types & Sizes</p> <h2>오일씰 형식 및 적용현황</h2> <p>오일씰은 더스트 립의 유무, 스프링의 유무, 철 COVER의 유무 등에 따라 TYPE(VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB 등)이 결정됩니다. 아래는 TYPE별로 실제 생산되는 내경×외경×두께 규격을 정리한 표입니다. TYPE 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types & Sizes</p> <h2>Oil Seal Types and Applications</h2> <p>Oil seal TYPE (VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB, etc.) is determined by factors such as the presence of a dust lip, a spring, and a steel cover. Below is a table organizing the bore × outer diameter × thickness specs actually produced for each TYPE. You can search by entering just the TYPE or part of the dimensions.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = spec overlaps among all 3 companies (NOK · Samjung · Daekwang) · ★ = overlap between NOK · Samjung · △ = overlap between Samjung · Daekwang · ⬠ = overlap between NOK · Daekwang</p>","<label for=\"ostFilter\">TYPE / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"ostFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: TC 또는 25*40\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"ostFilter\">TYPE / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"ostFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. TC or 25*40\" autocomplete=\"off\">","VC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(52건)</span>":"VC Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(52 items)</span>","TC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(159건)</span>":"TC Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(159 items)</span>","SC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4건)</span>":"SC Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4 items)</span>","D형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(151건)</span>":"D Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(151 items)</span>","DM형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(19건)</span>":"DM Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(19 items)</span>","DA형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(3건)</span>":"DA Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(3 items)</span>","S형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(36건)</span>":"S Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(36 items)</span>","SM형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(17건)</span>":"SM Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(17 items)</span>","SA형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(6건)</span>":"SA Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(6 items)</span>","SB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"SB Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","V형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(2건)</span>":"V Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(2 items)</span>","VB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(29건)</span>":"VB Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(29 items)</span>","TB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TB Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","TCV형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TCV Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","TCS형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TCS Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","PCS형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(9건)</span>":"PCS Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(9 items)</span>","D3형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4건)</span>":"D3 Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4 items)</span>","D4형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"D4 Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","DB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"DB Type <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1 item)</span>","※ 위 표는 오일씰 업계에서 공개된 형식별 규격표를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"* The table above was prepared based on publicly available type-specific spec tables from the oil seal industry. Please be sure to confirm against our official spec sheet original before precision machining or ordering.","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>오일씰 형식 및 적용현황</h2> <p>오일씰은 더스트 립의 유무, 스프링의 유무, 철 COVER의 유무 등에 따라 TYPE(VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB 등)이 결정됩니다. 아래는 TYPE별로 실제 생산되는 내경×외경×두께 규격을 정리한 표입니다. TYPE 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>Oil Seal Types and Applications</h2> <p>The oil seal TYPE (VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB, etc.) is determined by whether it has a dust lip, a spring, a steel COVER and so on. The table below lists the bore × outer diameter × thickness sizes actually produced for each TYPE. You can search by entering just part of a TYPE or dimension.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = size shared by all three: NOK, Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = shared by NOK and Samjung &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = shared by Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = shared by NOK and Daekwang</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">금속 케이스</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">스프링</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">주 립</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">더스트 립</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">오른쪽: 오일 측</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">왼쪽: 외부(먼지) 측</text> <defs> <marker id=\"ostArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경 = 축 지름) · D(외경 = 하우징 구멍 지름) · H(두께) — 표의 d·D·H 열이 이 위치입니다. TYPE에 따라 더스트 립·스프링 유무, 금속 케이스의 고무 피복 여부가 달라지며(예: 더스트 립이 없는 형식도 있음), 개념도 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not an SWS catalog measured drawing or a drawing from NOK or other manufacturers) — cross-section of a typical oil seal (type with spring and dust lip)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"/> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"/> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"/> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Shaft</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"/> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"/> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"/> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"/> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Metal case</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Spring</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Main lip</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Dust lip</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Right: oil side</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Left: outside (dust) side</text> <defs> <marker id=\"ostArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"/> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore = shaft diameter) · D (outer diameter = housing bore diameter) · H (thickness) — these are the d, D and H columns in the table. Depending on the TYPE, the presence of a dust lip or spring and whether the metal case is rubber-covered differ (e.g. some types have no dust lip), and the diagram’s proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>","TYPE / 규격 검색":"TYPE / Spec Search"},"ja":{"오일씰 형식 및 적용현황 | [회사명] 베어링":"オイルシール形式および適用状況 | [会社名]ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types & Sizes</p> <h2>오일씰 형식 및 적용현황</h2> <p>오일씰은 더스트 립의 유무, 스프링의 유무, 철 COVER의 유무 등에 따라 TYPE(VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB 등)이 결정됩니다. 아래는 TYPE별로 실제 생산되는 내경×외경×두께 규격을 정리한 표입니다. TYPE 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types & Sizes</p> <h2>オイルシール形式および適用状況</h2> <p>オイルシールはダストリップの有無、スプリングの有無、鉄COVERの有無などによってTYPE（VC、TC、SC、D、DM、DA、S、SM、SA、SB、V、VB、TB、TCV、TCS、PCS、D3、D4、DBなど）が決まります。以下はTYPE別に実際に生産される内径×外径×厚さの規格をまとめた表です。TYPEまたは寸法の一部だけ入力しても検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ ＝ NOK・Samjung・Daekwangの3社規格すべて重複・★ ＝ NOK・Samjung重複・△ ＝ Samjung・Daekwang重複・⬠ ＝ NOK・Daekwang重複</p>","<label for=\"ostFilter\">TYPE / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"ostFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: TC 또는 25*40\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"ostFilter\">TYPE・規格検索</label> <input id=\"ostFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: TC または 25*40\" autocomplete=\"off\">","VC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(52건)</span>":"VC形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(52件)</span>","TC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(159건)</span>":"TC形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(159件)</span>","SC형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4건)</span>":"SC形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4件)</span>","D형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(151건)</span>":"D形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(151件)</span>","DM형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(19건)</span>":"DM形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(19件)</span>","DA형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(3건)</span>":"DA形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(3件)</span>","S형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(36건)</span>":"S形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(36件)</span>","SM형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(17건)</span>":"SM形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(17件)</span>","SA형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(6건)</span>":"SA形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(6件)</span>","SB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"SB形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","V형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(2건)</span>":"V形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(2件)</span>","VB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(29건)</span>":"VB形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(29件)</span>","TB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TB形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","TCV형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TCV形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","TCS형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"TCS形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","PCS형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(9건)</span>":"PCS形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(9件)</span>","D3형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4건)</span>":"D3形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(4件)</span>","D4형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"D4形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","DB형 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1건)</span>":"DB形 <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 400;\">(1件)</span>","※ 위 표는 오일씰 업계에서 공개된 형식별 규격표를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ 上記の表はオイルシール業界で公開されている形式別規格表を基準に作成しました。精密加工・発注前には必ず当社正式規格表原本で最終確認してください。","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>오일씰 형식 및 적용현황</h2> <p>오일씰은 더스트 립의 유무, 스프링의 유무, 철 COVER의 유무 등에 따라 TYPE(VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DB 등)이 결정됩니다. 아래는 TYPE별로 실제 생산되는 내경×외경×두께 규격을 정리한 표입니다. TYPE 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>オイルシール形式および適用状況</h2> <p>オイルシールはダストリップの有無、スプリングの有無、鉄COVERの有無などによってTYPE(VC, TC, SC, D, DM, DA, S, SM, SA, SB, V, VB, TB, TCV, TCS, PCS, D3, D4, DBなど)が決まります。以下はTYPE別に実際に生産されている内径×外径×厚さの規格をまとめた表です。TYPEまたは寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK・三正・大光の3社規格すべてに共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK・三正に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 三正・大光に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK・大光に共通</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=